                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Battle Runner is an extremely basic game.  Every piece of content is shown within the 45 second gameplay trailer.  The background consists of a single sky image and a very small repeating mountain backdrop, 3 minutes of music on continuous looping, 1 enemy (spikes), 1 item (crystals), and that's pretty much it.  You just jump from platform to platform and attempt to improve the last run score.  There's just nothing to keep it interesting for more than a few minutes.",
